{"data":{"id":"vc1m3rFjyqg","slug":"logic","title":"Logic","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"aVYxs8FYIWs","slug":"orville-feat-like-blu-and-exile","title":"Orville (feat. Like, Blu & Exile)"},{"id":"ifxTjYLTW_M","slug":"im-gone","title":"I'm Gone"},{"id":"u6nXcDu7SwI","slug":"growing-pains-iii","title":"Growing Pains III"},{"id":"kCiPebdnL78","slug":"upgrade","title":"Upgrade"},{"id":"KPmubn2NYjo","slug":"run-it","title":"Run It"},{"id":"JXgnWx9AD0k","slug":"gang-related","title":"Gang Related"},{"id":"WQbj9uJQ110","slug":"indica-badu-feat-wiz-khalifa","title":"Indica Badu (feat. Wiz Khalifa)"},{"id":"zsvRUqR42HU","slug":"ysiv","title":"YSIV"},{"id":"sq0tZKhYEyo","slug":"gp4","title":"GP4"},{"id":"dwHjtJNX1sw","slug":"open-micaquarius-iii","title":"Open Mic\\\\Aquarius III"}]},"markers":[{"id":"F9j750cy-0E","position":22,"timestamp":"01:06:43","rawTrack":"Logic - Orville (feat. Like, Blu & Exile)","track":{"id":"aVYxs8FYIWs","path":"/artists/logic/tracks/orville-feat-like-blu-exile/","slug":"orville-feat-like-blu-and-exile","title":"Orville (feat. Like, Blu & Exile)","artist":{"slug":"logic","title":"Logic"},"artwork":"images/artists/logic/tracks/orville-feat-like-blu-exile.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"dslIkr-4K5w","slug":"552","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-552/ra.1626356225","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-552?in=soulection/sets/soulection-radio-sessions"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #552","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-552.jpg","content":"An eclectic mix of edits, R&B, house, and amapiano.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-06-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"7QzjUTFtLEI","position":5,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Logic - I'm Gone","track":{"id":"ifxTjYLTW_M","path":"/artists/logic/tracks/i-m-gone/","slug":"im-gone","title":"I'm Gone","artist":{"slug":"logic","title":"Logic"},"artwork":"images/artists/logic/tracks/i-m-gone.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"HYh1pKyFzn0","slug":"191","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-191-w-mr-carmack"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #191 w/ Mr. Carmack","artwork":"/images/episodes/191.jpg","content":"It's been long over due but we were finally able to get Carmack one on one. \n<!--more-->\n\nHe is definitely one of the most forward thinking artists of the new generation. If you produce then there is a good chance that you know who Carmack is. He has inspired many all over the world and has pretty much created his own genre of sound. How many times have you heard another producer make a beat similar to his and say to yourself, \"CARMACK\"!?\n\nThis guy has been a big part of Soulection's growth and history and it felt good to finally sit down with my bro to talk about his growth and current inspirations. We talked about how his move to L.A. changed his life, how he feels about other producers who create music that sounds like his, his relationship with drugs and why he calls his music drugs, when we can expect the next album, and much more.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays's Session","position":1}},{"id":"_5yskqb-DLE","position":8,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Logic - Growing Pains III","track":{"id":"u6nXcDu7SwI","path":"/artists/logic/tracks/growing-pains-iii/","slug":"growing-pains-iii","title":"Growing Pains III","artist":{"slug":"logic","title":"Logic"},"artwork":"images/artists/logic/tracks/growing-pains-iii.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IETVfEyzEVM","slug":"192","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-192-ft-j-rocc"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #192 Ft. J. Rocc","artwork":"/images/episodes/192.jpg","content":"J. Rocc comes through to the Soulection HQ to drop a exclusive mix and a interview. \n\n<!--more-->\nOver the years there have been a handful of artists/DJs that I have always wanted to come on the show. We've had Dam Funk, Mr. Choc, Daddy Kev, Hazel, Rhettmatic, Ta-ku, Coleman, Iman Omari, and many others as special guests but I've always wanted to have J. Rocc of the legendary Beat Junkies/Stones Throw crew on the show. Well, our timing finally aligned and he came through the Soulection HQ to drop a set and sit down with me for an interview. He dropped a 60 min set full of future beats, bass, and some other left-field shit.\n\nAfter that we sat down and chopped it about so many interesting things from his love for digging for 45's (Gospel Music), his production (that he keeps low key), his DILLA/MADLIB stories, and much more. J. Rocc is an overall tastemaker and one of the best on the decks. If you ever have a chance to see him live please go to a show and see for yourselves.\n\nEnjoy this one and spread the word.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11143,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"fMOXqSW3rbc","position":6,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Logic - Upgrade","track":{"id":"kCiPebdnL78","path":"/artists/logic/tracks/upgrade/","slug":"upgrade","title":"Upgrade","artist":{"slug":"logic","title":"Logic"},"artwork":"images/artists/logic/tracks/upgrade.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ZW1mxhwweKM","slug":"236","tags":[6,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-236"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #236","artwork":"/images/episodes/236.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7353,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-11-28T00:0